      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَلَفَةٌ مَنْتَكِتَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>extremity of the curved piece
of wood termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِنْو</span> <i>in the kind of saddle called</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَتَب</span>, <i>and in that called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِكَاف</span>, <i>when it is short,
and wounds the side of the camel.</i> (TA.)

